edge of g escapes S"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"d5fc5e75-85b4-4a40-8ae8-5c7fcfc36388"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["GraphInterior",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
